'''Syracuse''' ({{lang-bl|Siracusa}}; {{Langx|scn|Saragusa}}) is a highly urbanized [[communes of Balisca|commune]] in the [[Hesperia|Hesperian]] region of [[Piedmont]]. The commune had an estimated population of 871,829 as of the [[2025 Baliscan census]]. The commune is considered to be the northern extremity of the [[Concordia|Concordia conurbation]]. 

